    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n86968" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προδιαζεύγνυμι</span></b> : Gramm., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σχῆμα προδιεζευγμένον</span> (also called <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀλκμανικόν</span>), a figure used by Alcman, when
